 # Project agent instructions
 
+## Trackside Garage newspaper override (2026-10-16)
+The owner rejects the narrow News cards and requests a creative newspaper on a desk, allowing the live car to be hidden. News now fills the main Garage area with warm paper, serif masthead, lead story/selectable briefs, native vehicle file photos, actual bounded circuit outlines and a matching Friends directory. Retain the original attached car/camera/cosmetics/condition for return; hidden showroom draws stop. Reuse stored discovery in the existing feed query, deduplicate outlines per version and cap them at96 points; no preview downloads, new rendering worlds or worker jobs. Original daily demand, inactive-account, cache, privacy and bounded-poll rules remain. Native67+67/client19/motion135 headless/HTTP11/backend40 with2 SQLite concurrency skips/parser819 pass. See `docs/GARAGE_NEWS_NEWSPAPER_2026_10_16.md` for captures, actual checks, initial test corrections and task-only checkpoint. Owner/phone visual acceptance and matching backend rollout remain; no phone/APK/deployment.
+
 ## Coin-free guests and registered clean-race rewards override (2026-10-16)
 The owner corrects the currency policy: guests earn/spend no Coins; registered players also receive the200-Coin Clean race bonus. This supersedes the guest grants and withheld account clean bonus below. Preserve old local cosmetics/PBs/history without spending or importing old guest balances. Recorded five-lap collision/off-track summaries gate the fixed bonus after accepted trajectory timing; this is lightweight client evidence, not independent collision resimulation. Missing/malformed/dirty evidence earns no clean bonus without invalidating scores. Retain server amounts, atomic/idempotent receipts/purchases and account fences; capability-gate optional metadata for old servers. Backend SQLite/PostgreSQL20/one fixture skip, focused56headless/65+65native/app11/parser818 and Ruff pass. See `docs/GUEST_AND_REGISTERED_COINS_2026_10_16.md` and its report/patch. Matching client/API/worker/migration0037 rollout, balancing and owner/phone acceptance remain; no phone/APK/deployment.
 
